      "title": "A WPA3 Network",
      "desc": "The beacon asks for SAE",
      "detail": "The beacon looks like WPA2’s with two changes in its RSN element: the key management is SAE instead of PSK, and protected management frames are required. Everyone still uses one shared password.",
