      "title": "Join, Handshake",
      "desc": "Then the 4-way handshake, as in WPA2",
      "detail": "Association works as before, repeating the choice of SAE. The 4-way handshake that follows is WPA2’s, starting from the key SAE just made, except that message 3 also brings the IGTK, a key that signs broadcast management frames.",
